# Swashbuckler Extraordinaire: entering on turn 1 it makes a Treasure; Deadly Dispute (sacrificing an Ornithopter) makes
# a second on turn 3. Bot1 attacks with the Swashbuckler and its other Ornithopter, "whenever you attack" triggers
# (CR 508.1m), and Bot1 sacrifices both Treasures. The reflexive ability (CR 603.12) takes up to two targets: three are
# refused, and the two attackers gain double strike (CR 702.4): the Swashbuckler deals its 2 twice.

